o(8,4,'text','Ordinary per-hop DTLS-SRTP alone prevents an SFU that terminates those sessions from reading the media content')
o(8,4,'explanation','False. That SFU has the per-hop media keys. Additional end-to-end content encryption such as SFrame can keep payload content hidden from it.')
